      "version": "1",
      "title": "North Visitor Permit Policy",
      "text": "Meridian North visitor permit requests must be submitted through the North reception portal. Requests have a target acknowledgement time of two business hours. The visitor permit fee is 25 credits per permit. This policy does not specify a permit issuance deadline or a parking reimbursement amount."
    }
